		{ "🎯 Bounty! An elite pack appeared off the main road in Zone {number1}. Defeat all {number2} within {number3} seconds for a reward!", "🎯 Recompensa! Um bando de elites apareceu fora da estrada principal na Zona {number1}. Derrote os {number2} em {number3} segundos!" },
		{ "Defeat as many monsters as you can in {number1} seconds. Rewards x{number2}, and keep your combo going for up to x{number3} more", "Derrote o máximo de monstros em {number1} segundos. Recompensas x{number2}, e mantenha o combo para até x{number3} a mais" },
